# Baton — tiered handoff · the load-order sheet that keeps a fresh context light
# Invariant: tiers are a budget · tier x is never bulk-loaded, elders navigated in ranges
# Elder: HANDOFF_r17 (Quin workshop) · bench confirms fields against the tree
kind baton
name tiered_handoff
carrier counsel
crosses season_to_fresh_agent
status from_record
# tier 0 — always loaded · handoff · charter · ladder · season summary · ITINERARY
field tier0_always
# tier 1 — before code work · grammar · workshop log · relay
field tier1_before_code
# tier 2 — compass rotation · one file per round at n mod 7 · never all seven
field tier2_rotation
# tier 3 — on demand, by task
field tier3_on_demand
# tier x — never bulk-load · long elders in 60-line ranges · corpus grepped via the ledger
field tierx_never
